{"seq":11,"slug":"secrets-management","title":"密钥与凭据管理","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/secrets-management","rating":{"composite":3.89,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.27,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"密钥与凭据管理-简介\">密钥与凭据管理 简介</h1><p>在现代软件系统中，密钥与凭据是连接各组件、服务和基础设施的核心信任锚点。一个泄露的数据库密码、一个暴露的 API Key、一个未轮换的服务账号令牌，都可能导致整个系统的安全防线被攻破。随着微服务架构的普及和 DevOps 实践的深化，密钥的数量以指数级增长——从几十个增长到数千个——传统的手工管理方式已经完全无法应对。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向 DevOps 工程师、平台工程师、安全工程师以及所有需要在生产环境中处理敏感凭据的技术人员。无论你是在设计一个新系统的密钥架构，还是在改进现有流程的安全实践，这里都能提供系统化的知识框架。</p>\n<p>全书分为四个章节，层层递进：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>密钥管理基础</strong>从分类学和风险模型出发，建立对密钥生命周期的完整认知，涵盖从创建到销毁各阶段的管理策略，以及静态存储和网络传输中的加密保护机制。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>保险库方案</strong>深入当前主流的密钥管理解决方案，包括 HashiCorp Vault 的架构设计哲学、AWS/GCP/Azure 等云原生密钥服务的对比选型，以及「密钥即服务」的设计模式。</p>\n<p>第三章 <strong>DevOps 中的密钥</strong>聚焦实战场景，解决 CI/CD 流水线密钥注入、容器与 Kubernetes 环境密钥分发、以及 Terraform/Pulumi 等 IaC 工具中密钥处理的具体技术挑战。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>治理与运维</strong>关注密钥管理的长期运营，包括自动化轮换与紧急吊销策略、审计追踪与合规要求、以及零信任架构下的密钥安全模型。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：先通读第一章建立完整概念模型，然后根据实际技术栈选择第二章的具体方案深入学习，再结合第三章的 DevOps 实践落地，最后以第四章的治理框架确保长期可维护性。如果你已有密钥管理经验，可以直接跳到感兴趣的章节。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"secrets-fundamentals","title":"密钥管理基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/secrets-management/secrets-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"secrets-taxonomy-and-risks","title":"密钥分类与风险模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/secrets-management/secrets-fundamentals/secrets-taxonomy-and-risks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"secrets-lifecycle-management","title":"密钥生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/secrets-management/secrets-fundamentals/secrets-lifecycle-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"encryption-at-rest-and-transit","title":"静态与传输加密","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/secrets-management/secrets-fundamentals/encryption-at-rest-and-transit"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"vault-solutions","title":"保险库方案","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/secrets-management/vault-solutions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hashicorp-vault-architecture","title":"HashiCorp Vault 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/secrets-management/vault-solutions/hashicorp-vault-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cloud-native-secrets-services","title":"云原生密钥服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/secrets-management/vault-solutions/cloud-native-secrets-services"},{"seq":3,"slug":"secrets-as-a-service-patterns","title":"密钥即服务模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/secrets-management/vault-solutions/secrets-as-a-service-patterns"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"secrets-in-devops","title":"DevOps 中的密钥","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/secrets-management/secrets-in-devops","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cicd-secrets-injection","title":"CI/CD 密钥注入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/secrets-management/secrets-in-devops/cicd-secrets-injection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"container-and-kubernetes-secrets","title":"容器与 Kubernetes 密钥","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/secrets-management/secrets-in-devops/container-and-kubernetes-secrets"},{"seq":3,"slug":"infrastructure-as-code-secrets","title":"基础设施即代码中的密钥","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/secrets-management/secrets-in-devops/infrastructure-as-code-secrets"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"governance-and-operations","title":"治理与运维","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/secrets-management/governance-and-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rotation-and-revocation","title":"轮换与吊销策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/secrets-management/governance-and-operations/rotation-and-revocation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"audit-and-compliance","title":"审计与合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/secrets-management/governance-and-operations/audit-and-compliance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"zero-trust-secrets-architecture","title":"零信任密钥架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/secrets-management/governance-and-operations/zero-trust-secrets-architecture"}]}]}